  Italy she hopes to live in Italy one day  that casts health struggles Sasha has  been very open about her struggle with  polycystic ovary syndrome or PCOS which  caused her to gain 70 pounds in two  years PCOS is no joke it's an underlying  issue created by an imbalance of  hormones in the body and causes small  cysts on the ovaries Sasha went on  Dancing with the Stars as a way to take  charge of the weight gain that was  caused by a hormone imbalance in her  body brought on by PCOS way to go Sasha  other cast members have dealt with  health issues too in 2014  Troian Bellisario went public about her  eating disorder she told a online that  her quest for perfection let her down a  dangerous self-destructive path her  friends intervened and she got help as  part of Troy's recovery she wrote and  starred in the film  which shows the struggles of a young  woman dealing with an eating disorder  overall she emerged triumphant trans  castmate lucy hale came out in support  of Tryon and admitted to battling with  an eating disorder as well in the  September issue of Cosmopolitan she  revealed that she would go days without  eating through it all these young women  supported each other  proving you can overcome anything with a  little help from your friends hiding the  bun in the oven  Taman Circo can play Jenna in PLL was  pregnant during the filming of season 4  she announced her pregnancy on Instagram  with a picture of the positive test in  the caption she wrote and then and this  happened she followed up that post with  a picture of her and her loving husband  celebrating her new baby bump she  reassured her fans with the caption  don't worry still shooting PLL I  wouldn't let you down Taman kept her  promise and shot the rest of the fourth  season working with the crew to hide her  bun in the oven  they used clever angles big bags and  loose-fitting clothing to conceal the  pregnancy it just didn't work with the  storyline for Jenna to be pregnant while  taman is a